{"pin":"AB05072","subcodes":[{"code":"AB05072","anchor":"","first_line":"O servant of God! Bounty is of two kinds: in the world of earthly dominion and in the realm of heaven. The earthly kind is universal and all-embracing [3.5s]","first_line_orig":"ای بنده الهی کرم بر دو قسم است در عالم ملک و در عالم ملکوت ملکی عامست و شامل  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"150","translations":[{"language":"ny","lang_name":"Chichewa"}],"refs":[{"kind":"music","code":"J. Badiei","source":"J","locator":"Badiei","url":"https://youtu.be/6d-TB7toxFc"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MJMJ3.104x","source":"MJMJ3","locator":"104x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMA3/mma3-106.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMG2#125 p.143x","source":"MMG2","locator":"125 p.143x","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMA/mma-146.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK2#211 p.149","source":"MMK2","locator":"211 p.149","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/SWA2/swa2-151.html"}]}]}
